### MiniErp API - try every endpoint from Visual Studio / Rider / VS Code (REST Client extension).
### 1) run "Login as store1" (and the other logins), 2) run any request below.
### Demo users (password Demo@123): admin, manager1 (L2 approver), approver1 (L1), store1 (store keeper), viewer1

@base = http://localhost:5101
@v1 = {{base}}/api/v1

### ---------------------------------------------------------------- auth
# @name storeLogin
POST {{v1}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userName": "store1", "password": "Demo@123" }

###
# @name approverLogin
POST {{v1}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userName": "approver1", "password": "Demo@123" }

###
# @name managerLogin
POST {{v1}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userName": "manager1", "password": "Demo@123" }

###
# @name adminLogin
POST {{v1}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userName": "admin", "password": "Demo@123" }

###
@store = {{storeLogin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}
@approver = {{approverLogin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}
@manager = {{managerLogin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}
@admin = {{adminLogin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}

### Who am I (permissions from the token)
GET {{v1}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{store}}

### Refresh: rotates the refresh token. Send the SAME one twice -> 401 and the session is revoked
POST {{v1}}/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{ "refreshToken": "{{storeLogin.response.body.$.data.refreshToken}}" }

### No token -> 401 in the standard ApiResponse shape
GET {{v1}}/items

### ---------------------------------------------------------------- items
### Paged + filtered + sorted (stored procedure usp_GetItemsPaged)
GET {{v1}}/items?search=led&sortBy=Price&sortDir=desc&page=1&pageSize=5
Authorization: Bearer {{store}}

### One item: note the ETag response header
# @name item1
GET {{v1}}/items/1
Authorization: Bearer {{store}}

### Same ETag in If-None-Match -> 304 Not Modified (no body)
GET {{v1}}/items/1
Authorization: Bearer {{store}}
If-None-Match: {{item1.response.headers.ETag}}

### Stock per warehouse (inline table-valued function)
GET {{v1}}/items/1/stock
Authorization: Bearer {{store}}

### Full history (temporal table)
GET {{v1}}/items/1/history
Authorization: Bearer {{store}}

### CSV export (streamed with IAsyncEnumerable)
GET {{v1}}/items/export
Authorization: Bearer {{store}}

### Async-validator endpoint used by Angular
GET {{v1}}/items/check-code?code=ELE-001
Authorization: Bearer {{store}}

### Create -> 201 + Location header
# @name newItem
POST {{v1}}/items
Authorization: Bearer {{store}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "code": "ELE-050", "name": "Extension Board 4-way", "categoryId": 1, "unit": "NOS",
  "unitPrice": 450, "taxPercent": 18, "reorderLevel": 10 }

### Validation errors -> 400 with field errors (FluentValidation)
POST {{v1}}/items
Authorization: Bearer {{store}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "code": "bad-code", "name": "X", "categoryId": 1, "unit": "nos", "unitPrice": -1, "taxPercent": 7, "reorderLevel": 0 }

### Update with the row version from GET (If-Match). Run twice -> the second gets 409 Conflict
PUT {{v1}}/items/{{newItem.response.body.$.data.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{store}}
Content-Type: application/json
If-Match: "{{newItem.response.body.$.data.rowVersion}}"

{ "name": "Extension Board 4-way (surge)", "categoryId": 1, "unit": "NOS", "unitPrice": 499,
  "taxPercent": 18, "reorderLevel": 10, "isActive": true, "rowVersion": "" }

### Soft delete (manager has Items.Delete) -> 204
DELETE {{v1}}/items/{{newItem.response.body.$.data.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{manager}}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------- orders
### Create a draft (Idempotency-Key required; repeat with the same key -> same response replayed)
# @name newOrder
POST {{v1}}/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{store}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}

{ "customerId": 2, "warehouseId": 1, "remarks": "From .http file",
  "lines": [ { "itemId": 1, "qty": 20 }, { "itemId": 5, "qty": 2 } ] }

###
@orderId = {{newOrder.response.body.$.data.id}}

### Submit -> PendingL1
POST {{v1}}/orders/{{orderId}}/submit
Authorization: Bearer {{store}}

### Level-1 approval -> PendingL2
POST {{v1}}/orders/{{orderId}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{approver}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "comments": "Rates verified" }

### Level-2 approval by approver1 -> 403 (needs Orders.Approve.L2)
POST {{v1}}/orders/{{orderId}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{approver}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "comments": "try" }

### Level-2 approval by manager1 -> Approved
POST {{v1}}/orders/{{orderId}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{manager}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "comments": "OK" }

### Despatch (usp_DespatchOrder). Run twice -> 409 from THROW 50409
POST {{v1}}/orders/{{orderId}}/despatch
Authorization: Bearer {{store}}

### Order detail with lines + approval trail
GET {{v1}}/orders/{{orderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{store}}

### List with filters (Dapper, one round trip for count + page)
GET {{v1}}/orders?status=Posted&page=2&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{store}}

### Lookup by document number (Span<char> parser)
GET {{v1}}/orders/by-number?orderNo=SO/2026-27/000042
Authorization: Bearer {{store}}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------- stock
GET {{v1}}/stock?status=Reorder
Authorization: Bearer {{store}}

### Running stock (window function)
GET {{v1}}/stock/items/1/ledger?warehouseId=1
Authorization: Bearer {{store}}

### Adjustment: too large a removal -> 422
POST {{v1}}/stock/adjustments
Authorization: Bearer {{store}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "itemId": 2, "warehouseId": 1, "qty": -99999, "reason": "Damaged" }

### ---------------------------------------------------------------- reports (versioned)
GET {{v1}}/reports/monthly-sales
Authorization: Bearer {{manager}}

### v2: different response shape
GET {{base}}/api/v2/reports/monthly-sales
Authorization: Bearer {{manager}}

### Four queries in parallel (Task.WhenAll); Cache-Control: max-age=30
GET {{v1}}/reports/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{manager}}

### OUTER APPLY: customer C008 appears with no orders
GET {{v1}}/reports/latest-orders?topN=2
Authorization: Bearer {{manager}}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------- lookups (minimal API, output-cached)
GET {{v1}}/lookups/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{store}}

###
GET {{v1}}/lookups/customers?search=om&sortBy=code&desc=true
Authorization: Bearer {{store}}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------- admin + diagnostics
GET {{v1}}/admin/sessions
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}

### DI lifetimes demo: call twice and compare the ids (Development only)
GET {{base}}/api/diagnostics/lifetimes

###
GET {{base}}/api/diagnostics/info

###
GET {{base}}/health/ready

### Content negotiation: XML isn't supported -> 406 Not Acceptable
GET {{v1}}/items
Authorization: Bearer {{store}}
Accept: application/xml
